  "bits": [
    {
      "id": "bit-001",
      "text": "Most productivity advice is just \"do fewer things\" wearing a suit.",
      "pillar": "hot takes that age well",
      "tags": [
        "productivity",
        "work"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-002",
      "text": "The app didn't save me time. It just made my interruptions prettier.",
      "pillar": "tech / AI without the hype fog",
      "tags": [
        "tech",
        "apps"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-003",
      "text": "If your meeting needs a meeting to explain the meeting, cancel the original one.",
      "pillar": "short observations from real life",
      "tags": [
        "work",
        "meetings"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-004",
      "text": "AI won't replace you. The person who ships with AI while you wait for perfect will.",
      "pillar": "tech / AI without the hype fog",
      "tags": [
        "ai",
        "work"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-005",
      "text": "Group chats are just group projects where nobody graded the syllabus.",
      "pillar": "dry humor, zero corporate voice",
      "tags": [
        "humor",
        "life"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-006",
      "text": "\"We'll circle back\" is corporate for \"I hope this dies quietly.\"",
      "pillar": "dry humor, zero corporate voice",
      "tags": [
        "work",
        "humor"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-007",
      "text": "Notifications trained an entire generation to confuse urgency with importance.",
      "pillar": "hot takes that age well",
      "tags": [
        "attention",
        "tech"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-008",
      "text": "The best feature is still: it works when the Wi‑Fi doesn't.",
      "pillar": "tech / AI without the hype fog",
      "tags": [
        "tech",
        "product"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-009",
      "text": "I don't need another dashboard. I need fewer things that require a dashboard.",
      "pillar": "short observations from real life",
      "tags": [
        "productivity",
        "tech"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-010",
      "text": "People don't fear AI. They fear becoming the bottleneck the AI walks around.",
      "pillar": "tech / AI without the hype fog",
      "tags": [
        "ai",
        "career"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-011",
      "text": "Your calendar isn't full. Your defaults are.",
      "pillar": "hot takes that age well",
      "tags": [
        "time",
        "work"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-012",
      "text": "The quiet flex is still: reply once, clearly, and move on.",
      "pillar": "short observations from real life",
      "tags": [
        "communication",
        "life"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-013",
      "text": "\"Just be yourself\" is terrible advice if yourself needs a rewrite.",
      "pillar": "dry humor, zero corporate voice",
      "tags": [
        "humor",
        "life"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-014",
      "text": "Half of \"innovation\" is renaming the old problem and shipping a new login screen.",
      "pillar": "tech / AI without the hype fog",
      "tags": [
        "tech",
        "product"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-015",
      "text": "If you can't explain it without a slide deck, you don't understand it yet.",
      "pillar": "hot takes that age well",
      "tags": [
        "clarity",
        "work"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-016",
      "text": "Overnight shipping is impressive. Overnight understanding is rarer.",
      "pillar": "tech / AI without the hype fog",
      "tags": [
        "ai",
        "engineering"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-017",
      "text": "The algorithm didn't kill attention spans. Infinite optionality did.",
      "pillar": "hot takes that age well",
      "tags": [
        "attention",
        "culture"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-018",
      "text": "Status updates that take longer than the work they're updating are a tax.",
      "pillar": "short observations from real life",
      "tags": [
        "work",
        "process"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-019",
      "text": "I'm not anti-hype. I'm anti-paying rent for someone else's narrative.",
      "pillar": "dry humor, zero corporate voice",
      "tags": [
        "humor",
        "culture"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-020",
      "text": "The hard part of building in public isn't posting. It's posting before you're impressed with yourself.",
      "pillar": "short observations from real life",
      "tags": [
        "creators",
        "building"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-021",
      "text": "\"Data-driven\" often means \"we found a chart that agrees with the decision we already made.\"",
      "pillar": "hot takes that age well",
      "tags": [
        "work",
        "data"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-022",
      "text": "Tools don't make you disciplined. They just make the lack of discipline measurable.",
      "pillar": "tech / AI without the hype fog",
      "tags": [
        "productivity",
        "tools"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-023",
      "text": "A good reply is rarer than a good take. That's where accounts actually grow.",
      "pillar": "short observations from real life",
      "tags": [
        "x",
        "growth"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-024",
      "text": "If everything is \"urgent,\" nothing is. You're just living in permanent fire drill cosplay.",
      "pillar": "dry humor, zero corporate voice",
      "tags": [
        "work",
        "humor"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:53:00Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-025",
      "text": "Stop collecting frameworks. Start collecting finished things.",
      "pillar": "dry humor, zero corporate voice",
      "tags": [
        "work"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:56:19.485Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-026",
      "text": "Your second brain app can't fix your first brain's avoidance.",
      "pillar": "dry humor, zero corporate voice",
      "tags": [
        "tech"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:56:19.485Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-027",
      "text": "Confidence without specifics is just volume.",
      "pillar": "tech / AI without the hype fog",
      "tags": [
        "life"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:56:19.485Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-028",
      "text": "If you wouldn't say it at dinner, don't put it in the company values.",
      "pillar": "hot takes that age well",
      "tags": [
        "life"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:56:19.485Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-029",
      "text": "Busy is a costume. Done is a receipt.",
      "pillar": "hot takes that age well",
      "tags": [
        "life"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:56:19.485Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-030",
      "text": "A checklist is only useful if you're willing to delete half of it.",
      "pillar": "dry humor, zero corporate voice",
      "tags": [
        "life"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:56:19.485Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-031",
      "text": "Automation that needs daily babysitting is just a needy chore in a hoodie.",
      "pillar": "short observations from real life",
      "tags": [
        "life"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:56:19.485Z",
      "postedAt": null,
      "postUrl": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bit-032",
      "text": "\"Quick sync\" is rarely quick and almost never a sync.",
      "pillar": "short observations from real life",
      "tags": [
        "life"
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-20T02:56:19.485Z",
